ment-factory", "summary": "Amusement Factory is a cozy theme park builder with a bright, stylized look.\n\nYou start with an empty field, a bus stop and a bank balance, and you lay out everything else: roads, queues, rides, shops, arcades, and a lake with boats running laps of a route you painted yourself. Guests arrive by the busload with their own energy, hunger, thirst and patience, and their mood is blended from everything the park does to them, so a filthy path costs you as surely as a broken ride does.\nPlay the ten campaign locations in order, each with its own land, budget, wage bill and goals, or take free play and build for the pleasure of it.", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/amusement-factory", "videos": [{"id": 200032, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "BpNHH5f-_e4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BpNHH5f-_e4", "title": "Trailer Amusement Factory game", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BpNHH5f-_e4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 200033, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "4VZoDW0hwjU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4VZoDW0hwjU", "title": "Build your theme park from scratch - Amusement Factory", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4VZoDW0hwjU/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}